OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G2100FRiley & Coe
OL,5,     GA fantastic selection of the
OL,6,     Glad's favourite tunes and
OL,7,     Gsessions from the last year.
OL,8,G2300F6 Music Artist in Residence
OL,9,     GJoin Lucy Dacus as she takes us
OL,10,     Gon a journey of her favourite
OL,11,     Gsongwriters. She begins in the
OL,12,     G50s and 60s, with Dusty
OL,13,     GSpringfield, and a song from her
OL,14,     Ggrandparents wedding.
OL,15,G0000FIn Their Own Words: David Bowie
OL,16,     GDavid Bowie's remarkable story is
OL,17,     Gtold through interviews from the
OL,18,     GBBC archives.
